andromeda: phases F5/F6 (andrmtl=N, off by default). Compiles
bsd/dev/andromeda_gpu_mtl.c and iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetAccelerator.cpp (staged
by 0200-stage-andromeda-mtl.sh) and gives SweetAccelerator an IOResources
personality, whose probe() declines unless andrmtl is 1 or 2. Port of
ios-flame's 0096-flame-metal-accelerator, 0097-flame-metal-userclient,
0115-flame-gpu-v2-client-turnip and 0116-flame-sweetmetal2-plugin-switch
(Nick Wylynko / NWylynko, commit 745c4341, MIT for the repository, the XNU
changes under APSL 2.0; see CREDITS.md and licenses/ios-flame-MIT.txt).

